1
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:17,058
Maaf, Nagisa.

2
00:00:17,642 --> 00:00:19,893
Saya ada hal, jadi saya balik dulu.

3
00:00:19,894 --> 00:00:22,313
Okey, tak apa.

4
00:00:27,026 --> 00:00:30,321
{\an8}SEKOLAH MENENGAH PERSENDIRIAN EIMEI

5
00:00:53,178 --> 00:00:55,096
BARANG HIASAN

6
00:01:26,711 --> 00:01:28,712
Terkejut saya!

7
00:01:28,713 --> 00:01:30,589
Janganlah buat saya terperanjat!

8
00:01:30,590 --> 00:01:34,176
- Maaf.
- Saya ingatkan awak hantu tadi.

9
00:01:34,177 --> 00:01:36,012
Bukankah sepatutnya Santa Claus?

10
00:01:36,638 --> 00:01:37,514
Apa?

11
00:01:47,106 --> 00:01:50,192
Tak kisahlah, apa awak buat di sini?

12
00:01:50,193 --> 00:01:51,528
Macam mana perlawanan?

13
00:01:53,613 --> 00:01:55,281
Kami lepas pusingan pertama.

14
00:01:56,866 --> 00:01:58,284
Tahniah.

15
00:01:59,077 --> 00:02:00,286
Terima kasih.

16
00:02:00,912 --> 00:02:03,289
Satu lagi, terima kasih untuk tiket itu.

17
00:02:05,959 --> 00:02:09,337
Disebabkan awak,
saya dah berbaik semula dengan Yumeka.

18
00:02:13,925 --> 00:02:17,804
Untuk dapatkan tiket itu,
awak perlu berlari banyak kali, bukan?

19
00:02:18,304 --> 00:02:19,388
Apa?

20
00:02:19,389 --> 00:02:21,307
Taklah, sikit saja!

21
00:02:21,891 --> 00:02:23,685
Lari main-main saja.

22
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:29,482
Sebenarnya saya dah lama sedar.

23
00:02:30,775 --> 00:02:33,528
<i>Yang fikiran Yumeka
terganggu dengan sesuatu.</i>

24
00:02:34,946 --> 00:02:40,410
Tapi dia cuma berdiam diri,
jadi saya tak cakap apa-apa.

25
00:02:56,509 --> 00:02:58,553
Itu yang buat saya sangat menyesal.

26
00:02:59,053 --> 00:03:04,100
Sebahagian daripada penyesalan itu
akhirnya jadi ringan sikit hari ini.

27
00:03:05,268 --> 00:03:09,439
Jadi, sebab itulah
saya sangat berterima kasih, Taiki.

28
00:03:14,110 --> 00:03:16,821
Terima kasih banyak-banyak.

29
00:03:20,450 --> 00:03:23,953
Awak tak perlu... ucap terima kasih.

30
00:03:29,876 --> 00:03:34,297
Sama macam awak terpengaruh dengan Yumeka,

31
00:03:35,423 --> 00:03:38,676
saya pun terpengaruh dengan awak.

32
00:03:40,386 --> 00:03:42,430
Saya cuma balas jasa awak!

33
00:04:36,025 --> 00:04:37,151
Terima kasih.

34
00:05:07,515 --> 00:05:08,433
Maaf.

35
00:05:14,772 --> 00:05:15,940
Sekejap saja...

36
00:05:17,358 --> 00:05:18,860
biar saya peluk sekejap.

37
00:05:57,482 --> 00:06:01,652
BLUE BOX MUSIM 2

38
00:07:24,569 --> 00:07:28,656
EPISOD 31
MALAM KRISMAS

39
00:08:23,461 --> 00:08:24,462
Terima kasih.

40
00:08:29,175 --> 00:08:30,176
Tak apa.

41
00:08:44,357 --> 00:08:45,358
Sebenarnya...

42
00:08:46,317 --> 00:08:47,485
Chinatsu Senpai...

43
00:08:53,407 --> 00:08:54,992
Mari kita pergi.

44
00:08:56,911 --> 00:08:57,995
Apa?

45
00:09:03,334 --> 00:09:04,669
Chinatsu?

46
00:09:13,052 --> 00:09:15,638
<i>Yang tadi itu apa?</i>

47
00:09:17,515 --> 00:09:19,725
<i>Dia peluk saya!</i>

48
00:09:21,477 --> 00:09:24,063
<i>Bahu saya masih terasa hangatnya.</i>

49
00:09:30,486 --> 00:09:32,737
<i>Mungkin dia takut sebab permainan esok</i>

50
00:09:32,738 --> 00:09:34,991
<i>dan cuma nak sokongan seseorang.</i>

51
00:09:35,992 --> 00:09:39,412
<i>Atau sebab dia dah berbaik dengan Yumeka,</i>

52
00:09:39,996 --> 00:09:41,789
<i>jadi dia ada macam-macam emosi?</i>

53
00:09:43,124 --> 00:09:44,166
<i>Atau mungkin...</i>

54
00:09:47,044 --> 00:09:48,378
Hei, Taiki!

55
00:09:48,379 --> 00:09:50,298
Awak pun masuklah sekali!

56
00:09:56,971 --> 00:09:58,389
<i>Jangan-jangan?</i>

57
00:10:35,676 --> 00:10:37,678
Mak! Mana Chinatsu Senpai?

58
00:10:38,387 --> 00:10:40,097
Dia dah lama keluar.

59
00:10:40,890 --> 00:10:43,017
Katanya pusingan kedua mula pukul satu.

60
00:10:43,851 --> 00:10:45,185
Oh, yalah.

61
00:10:45,186 --> 00:10:47,687
Kamu pun ada latihan badminton, bukan?

62
00:10:47,688 --> 00:10:49,606
Pergilah bersiap cepat.

63
00:10:49,607 --> 00:10:50,858
Okey.

64
00:11:04,205 --> 00:11:07,458
- Kenapa awak mengelamun?
- Mana ada!

65
00:11:08,584 --> 00:11:10,211
Saya nak ke bilik kelab dulu!

66
00:11:18,135 --> 00:11:21,263
<i>Saya asyik fikir tentang semalam saja.</i>

67
00:11:25,351 --> 00:11:29,897
<i>Sebenarnya saya nak tanya dia lagi
tentang Yumeka.</i>

68
00:11:30,689 --> 00:11:34,527
<i>Mereka dah berbaik, jadi,
Yumeka akan main bola keranjang semula?</i>

69
00:11:35,486 --> 00:11:39,156
<i>Kalau dia main,
tentu Chinatsu Senpai akan gembira.</i>

70
00:11:40,991 --> 00:11:42,368
<i>Sangat gembira sampaikan...</i>

71
00:11:45,121 --> 00:11:48,290
<i>Saya fikir tentang itu lagi!</i>

72
00:11:49,125 --> 00:11:51,544
Selain gigi,
awak sakit di tempat lain juga?

73
00:12:02,972 --> 00:12:05,182
Yumeka, rambut awak...

74
00:12:07,393 --> 00:12:10,187
Sejuklah rambut pendek
di musim-musim begini.

75
00:12:12,273 --> 00:12:14,191
Tapi kacau apabila main bola keranjang.

76
00:12:18,279 --> 00:12:19,488
Saya dah lama tak main,

77
00:12:20,072 --> 00:12:23,075
tapi saya nak sertai
pasukan bola keranjang sekolah saya.

78
00:12:24,285 --> 00:12:25,827
Yakah?

79
00:12:25,828 --> 00:12:30,499
Saya nak jadi bagus macam Natsu,
jadi kenalah berlatih macam orang gila.

80
00:12:33,002 --> 00:12:36,172
<i>Jangan-jangan
saya dah kembalikan musuh luar biasa?</i>

81
00:12:36,839 --> 00:12:41,050
Jadi, awak kena pastikan
Natsu tak buang masa macam saya,

82
00:12:41,051 --> 00:12:42,761
berilah sokongan sepenuhnya.

83
00:12:43,637 --> 00:12:45,264
Awak teman lelaki dia.

84
00:12:49,852 --> 00:12:52,271
- Kami tak bercinta!
- Apa?

85
00:12:53,063 --> 00:12:55,774
Awak yang salah faham!

86
00:12:56,484 --> 00:12:58,777
Awak pun dah ada teman lelaki?

87
00:12:59,612 --> 00:13:01,989
<i>Oh, ya. Saya betulkan diakah?</i>

88
00:13:02,656 --> 00:13:04,158
Apa?

89
00:13:05,075 --> 00:13:08,203
Jadi, awak bukan teman lelaki dia,
tapi cakap macam-macam

90
00:13:08,204 --> 00:13:12,124
dan lari sampai kaki lembik
semata-mata nak beri dia tiket?

91
00:13:12,666 --> 00:13:14,502
Maaf.

92
00:13:15,169 --> 00:13:17,338
Awak sukakan Natsu, betul tak?

93
00:13:18,923 --> 00:13:19,924
Saya...

94
00:13:20,841 --> 00:13:23,009
Jangan-jangan, dia tolak?

95
00:13:23,010 --> 00:13:26,013
Tak... Saya belum beritahu dia...

96
00:13:26,722 --> 00:13:28,848
Dasar burger ayam tak guna.

97
00:13:28,849 --> 00:13:30,808
AYAM

98
00:13:30,809 --> 00:13:32,269
Kenapa burger pula?

99
00:13:32,895 --> 00:13:36,148
Tapi yalah, Natsu pun susah nak dibaca.

100
00:13:37,066 --> 00:13:39,652
Saya pun fikir
dia tak berminat nak bercinta.

101
00:13:40,361 --> 00:13:41,946
Itulah masalahnya.

102
00:13:43,447 --> 00:13:45,241
Jangan banyak alasan.

103
00:13:53,666 --> 00:13:56,252
<i>Suka adalah perasaan yang paling kuat.</i>

104
00:13:59,088 --> 00:14:01,507
{\an8}<i>Hari seterusnya,
pasukan bola keranjang kami</i>

105
00:14:02,466 --> 00:14:05,260
{\an8}<i>kalah dalam pusingan ketiga.</i>

106
00:14:05,261 --> 00:14:08,346
{\an8}<i>Kemudian pasukan lawan
yang tewaskan mereka jadi juara.</i>

107
00:14:08,347 --> 00:14:09,264
{\an8}JUARA KEJOHANAN

108
00:14:09,265 --> 00:14:11,684
<i>Walaupun kecewa kerana kalah,</i>

109
00:14:12,309 --> 00:14:16,397
<i>mereka rasa hasil dalam kejohanan ini
lebih baik daripada sebelumnya.</i>

110
00:14:17,773 --> 00:14:21,318
<i>Dengan semua yang terjadi,
saya tak sempat tanya...</i>

111
00:14:22,778 --> 00:14:25,781
<i>apa maksud pelukan itu.</i>

112
00:14:40,838 --> 00:14:44,632
Ibu bapa kamu akan sampai di Jepun
pukul 8 malam, bukan?

113
00:14:44,633 --> 00:14:48,136
Ya. Jadi saya ingat
nak gerak pergi jemput mereka pukul 6.

114
00:14:48,137 --> 00:14:51,432
Kemudian kamu bertiga
akan ke rumah datuk kamu di Nagano?

115
00:14:52,057 --> 00:14:53,934
Dari esok hingga Tahun Baru, ya?

116
00:14:54,602 --> 00:14:56,979
Tentu sambutan Tahun Baru kami sunyi!

117
00:14:57,521 --> 00:14:58,771
Selamat pagi.

118
00:14:58,772 --> 00:15:03,027
Kenapa rambut kamu kusut-masai?
Pergilah betulkan dulu!

119
00:15:12,369 --> 00:15:13,871
Saya nak cuci rambut!

120
00:15:14,538 --> 00:15:16,582
Kalau cuci kerap sangat nanti botak.

121
00:15:24,340 --> 00:15:26,592
<i>Apa saya nak buat di depan dia?</i>

122
00:15:27,176 --> 00:15:30,054
<i>Susah nak cakap dengan dia di rumah
sebab mak ada.</i>

123
00:15:36,268 --> 00:15:37,561
<i>Kalau beginilah...</i>

124
00:15:42,942 --> 00:15:44,777
Masa untuk gotong-royong hujung tahun.

125
00:15:45,277 --> 00:15:47,654
Pastikan kamu bersihkan betul-betul!

126
00:15:47,655 --> 00:15:49,448
- Baik, cikgu!
- Baik!

127
00:15:51,408 --> 00:15:55,454
Taiki, sebelah sana dah selesai,
pergilah tolong orang lain pula.

128
00:15:56,038 --> 00:15:56,956
Okey!

129
00:16:04,546 --> 00:16:07,967
<i>Kalau tengok, macam tak ada apa-apa
yang berlaku.</i>

130
00:16:08,801 --> 00:16:10,803
<i>Saya yang mimpikah?</i>

131
00:16:16,100 --> 00:16:19,018
Apa kata biarkan saja pokok itu
sepanjang tahun?

132
00:16:19,019 --> 00:16:21,230
- Apa dia?
- Hei, budak-budak!

133
00:16:22,272 --> 00:16:23,983
Jangan lap gerakan putaran!

134
00:16:24,566 --> 00:16:27,193
Gerakkan tangan naik turun secara lurus!

135
00:16:27,194 --> 00:16:29,238
Jangan lupa lap di celah sudut juga!

136
00:16:29,905 --> 00:16:32,740
{\an8}Tak ada kotoran jahatkah di sini?

137
00:16:32,741 --> 00:16:35,201
{\an8}Tak sangka pula pengurus kita cerewet.

138
00:16:35,202 --> 00:16:37,578
{\an8}Mula-mula saya teruja
dapat pengurus comel,

139
00:16:37,579 --> 00:16:38,998
{\an8}dia lebih garang dari mak!

140
00:16:39,581 --> 00:16:42,333
- Inota, kenapa tercegat di situ?
- Tak...

141
00:16:42,334 --> 00:16:46,255
Kalau kerja dah siap,
pergi kira peralatan pula!

142
00:16:51,844 --> 00:16:55,264
<i>Susah nak percaya ini tempat yang sama
macam Malam Krismas.</i>

143
00:16:56,473 --> 00:16:58,350
<i>Nampaknya memang saya mimpi.</i>

144
00:17:01,937 --> 00:17:03,022
Hai, adik.

145
00:17:03,814 --> 00:17:04,981
Tentu awak penat.

146
00:17:04,982 --> 00:17:06,734
Ya, awak pun sama.

147
00:17:08,110 --> 00:17:10,778
Buat masa ini, nampaknya semua lengkap.

148
00:17:10,779 --> 00:17:12,488
Ya, semua ada.

149
00:17:12,489 --> 00:17:13,490
Ya.

150
00:17:14,533 --> 00:17:15,534
<i>Nampak?</i>

151
00:17:16,035 --> 00:17:18,454
<i>Chinatsu Senpai macam biasa saja.</i>

152
00:17:19,163 --> 00:17:21,456
<i>Seolah-olah dia tak peluk saya.</i>

153
00:17:21,457 --> 00:17:23,042
Maaf, tumpang lalu.

154
00:17:35,345 --> 00:17:36,472
Maaf!

155
00:17:38,057 --> 00:17:39,850
Tak apa, saya okey.

156
00:17:40,768 --> 00:17:41,935
Maaf.

157
00:17:44,563 --> 00:17:47,398
Saya nak hantar ini.
Awak uruskan yang lain, boleh?

158
00:17:47,399 --> 00:17:48,400
Okey.

159
00:18:00,537 --> 00:18:02,998
Tentang apa yang terjadi, jangan-jangan...

160
00:18:06,293 --> 00:18:07,294
Awak tersinggung?

161
00:18:14,343 --> 00:18:18,180
<i>Tak, bukan...</i>

162
00:18:20,265 --> 00:18:22,850
- Saya...
- Hei!

163
00:18:22,851 --> 00:18:25,604
Mereka belikan jus untuk semua!

164
00:18:34,071 --> 00:18:35,781
<i>Takkanlah saya tersinggung!</i>

165
00:18:37,282 --> 00:18:38,408
<i>Bukan begitu.</i>

166
00:18:40,369 --> 00:18:41,453
<i>Awak salah faham!</i>

167
00:18:51,004 --> 00:18:53,924
Chono, boleh tolong saya
bawa kotak-kotak ini?

168
00:18:54,550 --> 00:18:55,800
Apa?

169
00:18:55,801 --> 00:18:57,052
Bawa ke bilik guru.

170
00:18:58,262 --> 00:19:00,055
Kotak ini agak berat.

171
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:04,433
Boleh. Tapi tak sangka
awak selembik ini, Kyo.

172
00:19:04,434 --> 00:19:07,146
- Awak bersenam.
- Awak tak bersenam?

173
00:19:20,159 --> 00:19:23,161
Seronok rasanya apabila gim dah bersih!

174
00:19:23,162 --> 00:19:25,079
- Kamu nak pergi...
- Balik dulu!

175
00:19:25,080 --> 00:19:26,081
Hei!

176
00:19:30,627 --> 00:19:32,171
<i>Saya perlu beritahu dia!</i>

177
00:19:35,215 --> 00:19:36,592
<i>Saya tak tersinggung.</i>

178
00:19:38,302 --> 00:19:39,428
<i>Tapi saya gembira.</i>

179
00:19:40,429 --> 00:19:44,349
<i>Sebab itu kali pertama saya dipeluk
oleh orang yang saya suka!</i>

180
00:20:22,763 --> 00:20:25,224
Aduhai, terima kasih.

181
00:20:50,666 --> 00:20:54,544
<i>Saya asyik fikirkan
tentang detik-detik itu tanpa henti.</i>

182
00:21:01,343 --> 00:21:02,344
<i>Tapi...</i>

183
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:08,141
<i>Tapi...</i>

184
00:21:12,646 --> 00:21:15,565
<i>saya perlu beritahu dia sendiri!</i>

185
00:21:25,325 --> 00:21:26,326
Saya dah balik!

186
00:21:27,077 --> 00:21:29,912
Kenapa dengan kamu? Tergesa-gesa saja.

187
00:21:29,913 --> 00:21:32,833
- Mana Chinatsu Senpai?
- Dia dah pergi.

188
00:21:35,419 --> 00:21:37,796
Penerbangan ibu bapanya tiba lebih awal.

189
00:21:38,297 --> 00:21:40,424
Ayah kamu baru saja hantar dia.

190
00:21:43,552 --> 00:21:46,221
Kenapa?

191
00:21:52,060 --> 00:21:54,896
<i>Kenapa jadi begini?</i>

192
00:23:48,927 --> 00:23:53,932
{\an8}Terjemahan sari kata oleh Norhazniza Ramli

